# The `hep-cv` package

Curricula vitae, cover letters and publication lists

## Introduction

The `hep-cv` package and class provide a compact CV layout for HEP
applications. The package defines the left-column CV line and entry
layout, list styling, month helpers, and bibliography support. The class
adds article-based CV defaults, contact and photo title pages,
cover-letter helpers, section and page styles, and subfile support.

For package-only use:

    \documentclass{article}
    \usepackage{hep-cv}

For complete CV documents use the `hep-cv` class.

